    "full_text": "Answer 32. During my tenure at the Equal Employment Opportunity Commission, I emphasized the challenges that artificial intelligence may present to the enforcement of civil rights laws related to the hiring process. If confirmed, I would serve as the Deputy Secretary of Labor, so I would not have direct control over executive branch human resource policy."
