    "committee": "Committee On Employment And Workplace Safety Of The Committee On Health, Education, Labor, And Pensions",
    "title": "READING THE ROOM: PREPARING WORKERS FOR AI",
    "speaker_name": "Senator Markey",
    "speaker_role": "Member",
    "party": "Democrat",
    "state": "MA",
    "matched_terms": "AI",
    "causal_heuristic": "Mechanical",
    "snippet": "That is why yesterday I introduced my AI Civil Rights Act of 2024, comprehensive legislation that would prevent discriminatory algorithms from being used in critical decisions, including employment, because we cannot prepare our workforce without protecting our workers simultaneously.",
    "full_text": "That is why yesterday I introduced my AI Civil Rights Act of 2024, comprehensive legislation that would prevent discriminatory algorithms from being used in critical decisions, including employment, because we cannot prepare our workforce without protecting our workers simultaneously."
