    "full_text": "Supporting Evolution: We recognize that the news industry is navigating complex challenges, such as ``news deserts.'' We also see growth in digitally-native newspapers and note there are some local news organizations showing growth and success. We aim to work constructively with the industry by developing AI tools that support their work, help them better engage with Americans, and support their financial sustainability."
