    "committee": "Committee On Small Business And Entrepreneurship Of The",
    "title": "NOMINATION OF WILLIAM BRIGGS TO BE DEPUTY ADMINISTRATOR OF THE SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION AND DR.CASEY MULLIGAN TO BE CHIEF COUNSEL FOR ADVOCACY AT THE SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION",
