    "causal_heuristic": "Regulatory / Evaluative",
    "snippet": "\u0001 Technology Infrastructure: Technology infrastructure that is distinct from EHRs is required to facilitate the efficient evaluation and clinical integration of AI tools. This infrastructure allows sites to test many AI products simultaneously with ongoing monitoring. Without addressing this capital investment, a marke...",
    "full_text": "\u0001 Technology Infrastructure: Technology infrastructure that is distinct from EHRs is required to facilitate the efficient evaluation and clinical integration of AI tools. This infrastructure allows sites to test many AI products simultaneously with ongoing monitoring. Without addressing this capital investment, a market failure will continue preventing AI developers from efficiently commercializing products.\\9\\ --------------------------------------------------------------------------\\9\\ https://www.statnews.com/2022/05/24/market-failure-preventingefficient-diffusion-health-care-ai-software/."
